{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40900","headline":"画山水图荅大愚 · 荆浩","name":"画山水图荅大愚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恣意纵横埽，峰峦次第成。\n笔尖寒树瘦，墨澹野云轻。\n岩石喷泉窄，山根到水平。\n禅房时一展，兼称苦空情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"荆浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}